@baseUrl = http://localhost:5030
@token = REPLACE_WITH_ADMINISTRATOR_BEARER_TOKEN

### List unresolved submitted Dango payouts (no provider request is sent by this GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AdminPayoutReconciliation?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Find one exact reference
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/AdminPayoutReconciliation?reference=DANGO_W_20261028_9
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Financial action: run ONLY after independent unpaid verification; replace ID and reference
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/AdminPayoutReconciliation/123/fail-and-reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Provider and recipient statements independently verified unpaid",
  "confirmUnpaid": true,
  "confirmedTransactionId": "DANGO_W_20261028_9"
}

### Invalid confirmation must be rejected without refunding
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/AdminPayoutReconciliation/123/fail-and-reverse
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Not independently verified",
  "confirmUnpaid": false,
  "confirmedTransactionId": "DANGO_W_20261028_9"
}
